            "description": "Status codes: `onsale` | `selling-fast` | `final-release` | `sold-out` | `draft` | `cancelled`. Only the first four are public.\n\n`{\"status\": \"cancelled\", \"reason\": \"...\"}` cancels the event and everything sold for it: paid orders are refunded, unpaid ones cancelled, holds released, and every buyer is e-mailed. A cancelled event cannot be reopened, and an event that has sold cannot go back to `draft` (409 `EVENT_STATUS_TRANSITION`).",
